sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Android App (FCM SDK)
    participant FCM as Google FCM Servers
    participant ProfileAPI as User Profile Service
    participant DB as Profile Database
    participant Worker as Push Notification Worker

    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
    Note right of User: Phase 1: Registration Flow (App Startup)
    App->>FCM: Request Push Notification Token
    FCM-->>App: Returns FCM Token (e.g., "token_abc123")
    App->>App: Generate unique local 'device_id' (e.g., "device_999")
    App->>ProfileAPI: POST /users/usr_1/devices<br>{device_id, fcm_token, platform: Android}
    ProfileAPI->>DB: UPSERT: Save/Update mapping for usr_1 and device_999
    ProfileAPI-->>App: 200 OK
    end

    rect rgb(240, 220, 200)
    Note right of User: Phase 2: Sending a Notification (Later)
    Worker->>Worker: Pulls message from RabbitMQ:<br> "Send 'Order Shipped' to usr_1"
    Worker->>DB: Query: "Get FCM Tokens for usr_1"
    DB-->>Worker: Returns "token_abc123"
    Worker->>FCM: POST to FCM API with payload & "token_abc123"
    FCM-->>Worker: 200 OK (Accepted for delivery)
    FCM->>App: Delivers push notification payload to device silently
    App->>User: Displays System Tray Notification
    end
